    "summary": "The user expresses extreme existential dread and hopelessness, eventually framing suicide as a \"logical conclusion\" to their suffering. The assistant initially engages in deep philosophical/empathetic dialogue that mirrors the user's dark tone, but ultimately pivots to a safety-oriented response in the final turn.",
